{'symbol': 'MDT', 'date': '2022-05-13 08:00:00', 'title': 'MEDTRONIC RECEIVES FDA APPROVAL FOR LATEST GENERATION DRUG-ELUTING CORONARY STENT SYSTEM', 'text': 'THE ONYX FRONTIER™ DRUG-ELUTING STENT OFFERS AN INNOVATIVE DELIVERY SYSTEM AND BUILDS UPON THE ACUTE PERFORMANCE AND CLINICAL DATA FROM THE RESOLUTE ONYX™\xa0DRUG-ELUTING STENT DUBLIN , MAY 13, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- MEDTRONIC PLC (NYSE:MDT),\xa0A GLOBAL LEADER IN HEALTHCARE TECHNOLOGY, TODAY ANNOUNCED IT RECEIVED U.S. FOOD AND DRUG ADMINISTRATION (FDA) APPROVAL FOR THE ONYX FRONTIER™ DRUG-ELUTING STENT (DES). AS THE LATEST EVOLUTION IN THE RESOLUTE DES FAMILY, ONYX FRONTIER DES LEVERAGES THE SAME BEST-IN-CLASS STENT PLATFORM AS RESOLUTE ONYX™ DES, WITH AN ENHANCED DELIVERY SYSTEM1\xa0DESIGNED TO IMPROVE DELIVERABILITY AND INCREASE ACUTE PERFORMANCE2\xa0IN EVEN THE MOST CHALLENGING OF CASES.1 THE ONYX FRONTIER DES IS USED FOR THE TREATMENT OF PATIENTS WITH CORONARY ARTERY DISEASE (CAD), WHICH IS CAUSED BY PLAQUE BUILDUP ON THE INSIDE OF THE CORONARY ARTERIES.'}{'symbol': 'MDT', 'date': '2022-05-13 06:45:00', 'title': 'MEDTRONIC COMPLETES ACQUISITION OF INTERSECT ENT', 'text': "ACQUISITION ADDS INNOVATIVE BIOABSORBABLE STEROID-ELUTING SINUS IMPLANTS TO ENT PORTFOLIO DUBLIN AND MENLO PARK, CALIF. , MAY 13, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0MEDTRONIC PLC (NYSE: MDT), A GLOBAL LEADER IN HEALTHCARE TECHNOLOGY, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS COMPLETED THE ACQUISITION OF INTERSECT ENT, EXPANDING THE COMPANY'S COMPREHENSIVE EAR, NOSE, AND THROAT (ENT) PORTFOLIO WITH INNOVATIVE PRODUCTS USED IN SINUS PROCEDURES TO IMPROVE POST-OPERATIVE OUTCOMES AND TO TREAT NASAL POLYPS."}